  }

%% ==== status
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> QUEUED: upload accepted
  QUEUED --> PROCESSING: worker takes the job
  PROCESSING --> COMPLETED: results written
  PROCESSING --> QUEUED: error, retry left
  PROCESSING --> FAILED: error on last attempt
  QUEUED --> CANCELLED: Cancel
  PROCESSING --> CANCELLED: Cancel, worker stops
  COMPLETED --> QUEUED: Re-analyse
  FAILED --> QUEUED: Re-analyse
  CANCELLED --> QUEUED: Re-analyse
  COMPLETED --> [*]: Delete
  FAILED --> [*]: Delete
  CANCELLED --> [*]: Delete
  QUEUED --> [*]: Delete

